# Plock needs no server-side secrets.
# - Firebase web config lives in firebase-applet-config.json (public by design; access is
#   enforced by firestore.rules).
# - Each user enters their own Gemini API key in 설정 > AI 도우미; it is stored only in their browser.

# Development only: talk to the local Firebase emulators instead of the real project.
# VITE_FIREBASE_EMULATOR=1
